  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-11-22T23:12:28.233Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The new blocked avatar scaling is really annoying. I block avatars for being overly large (or small) so that they don't block my entire view (or are impossible to see in certain games). The fact that the blocked avatar robot now scales to the original avatar's height and size defeats the purpose of this.\nI would like an option to toggle between the new behaviour and the old, fixed height and size robots",
